# Normalise to LF in the repository. The test suite reads its own fixtures and
# the CSV loaders sniff encodings; a checkout that flips line endings on the way
# in is one more thing that can differ between a maintainer's machine and a
# contributor's for no reason anybody chose.
* text=auto eol=lf

# CSV templates are handed to Excel, which on Windows wants CRLF. The loader
# accepts either, but a template that opens wrong is a bad first impression.
*.csv text eol=crlf
